 "title": {
  "en": "RC circuits as differentiator and integrator",
  "kn": "ಡಿಫರೆನ್ಷಿಯೇಟರ್ ಮತ್ತು ಇಂಟಿಗ್ರೇಟರ್ ಆಗಿ RC ಮಂಡಲಗಳು"
 },
 "minutes": 40,
 "blocks": [
  {
   "id": "intro",
   "type": "intro",
   "heading": {
    "en": "One resistor, one capacitor, two jobs",
    "kn": "ಒಂದು ರೋಧಕ, ಒಂದು ಧಾರಕ, ಎರಡು ಕೆಲಸ"
   },
   "hook": {
    "en": "Wave-shaping circuits change the shape of a waveform. The simplest use just a resistor and a capacitor, and whether you get spikes or a triangle depends on where you take the output.",
    "kn": "ತರಂಗ ರೂಪಿಸುವ ಮಂಡಲಗಳು ತರಂಗದ ಆಕಾರ ಬದಲಿಸುತ್ತವೆ. ಸರಳವಾದವು ಒಂದು ರೋಧಕ ಮತ್ತು ಒಂದು ಧಾರಕ ಬಳಸುತ್ತವೆ; ಔಟ್‌ಪುಟ್ ಎಲ್ಲಿ ತೆಗೆಯುತ್ತೇವೆ ಎಂಬುದರಿಂದ ಮೊನೆಗಳು ಅಥವಾ ತ್ರಿಕೋನ ಸಿಗುತ್ತದೆ."
   },
   "objectives": [
    {
     "en": "Explain the time constant of an RC circuit"
    },
    {
     "en": "Explain the RC differentiator and integrator"
    },
    {
     "en": "Sketch their outputs for a square-wave input"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "Wave-shaping circuits change the shape of a waveform. The simplest use just a resistor and a capacitor, and whether you get spikes or a triangle depends on where you take the output.",
    "kn": "ತರಂಗ ರೂಪಿಸುವ ಮಂಡಲಗಳು ತರಂಗದ ಆಕಾರ ಬದಲಿಸುತ್ತವೆ. ಸರಳವಾದವು ಒಂದು ರೋಧಕ ಮತ್ತು ಒಂದು ಧಾರಕ ಬಳಸುತ್ತವೆ; ಔಟ್‌ಪುಟ್ ಎಲ್ಲಿ ತೆಗೆಯುತ್ತೇವೆ ಎಂಬುದರಿಂದ ಮೊನೆಗಳು ಅಥವಾ ತ್ರಿಕೋನ ಸಿಗುತ್ತದೆ."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "concept1",
   "type": "concept",
   "title": {
    "en": "RC differentiator and integrator"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "In an RC differentiator the capacitor is in series and the output is taken across R. If the time constant RC is much smaller than the period T of the input, the output is approximately $RC\\,dv_i/dt$: a square wave gives sharp positive and negative spikes at its edges. In an RC integrator the resistor is in series and the output is taken across C. If RC is much larger than T, the output is approximately $(1/RC)\\int v_i\\,dt$: a square wave gives a triangular wave. Differentiators are used to produce trigger pulses; integrators to produce ramps and to filter."
   },
   "points": [
    {
     "en": "Differentiator: output across R, RC << T"
    },
    {
     "en": "Square in → spikes out"
    },
    {
     "en": "Integrator: output across C, RC >> T"
    },
    {
     "en": "Square in → triangle out"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "With the output across R and a short time constant we get a differentiator, giving spikes. With the output across C and a long time constant we get an integrator, giving a triangle.",
    "kn": "R ಮೇಲೆ ಔಟ್‌ಪುಟ್ ಮತ್ತು ಕಡಿಮೆ RC ಇದ್ದರೆ ಡಿಫರೆನ್ಷಿಯೇಟರ್, ಮೊನೆಗಳು ಸಿಗುತ್ತವೆ. C ಮೇಲೆ ಔಟ್‌ಪುಟ್ ಮತ್ತು ಹೆಚ್ಚು RC ಇದ್ದರೆ ಇಂಟಿಗ್ರೇಟರ್, ತ್ರಿಕೋನ ತರಂಗ ಸಿಗುತ್ತದೆ."
   }
  },
